OL,3,GNEWSALeader hopes city expansion will
OL,4,Ahappen despite pause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Nottingham City Council
OL,7,Fhas said she hopes an expansion of the
OL,8,Fcity's boundary will still go ahead
OL,9,Fdespite the government putting the
OL,10,Fplans on hold.
OL,12,FAs part of a major shake-up of local
OL,13,Fgovernment announced in July,
OL,14,FNottingham was due to merge with parts
OL,15,Fof the surrounding boroughs of
OL,16,FBroxtowe, Gedling, and Rushcliffe to
OL,17,Fform a new unitary council.
OL,19,FThe government announced yesterday,
OL,20,Fhowever, that it would review all of
OL,21,Fthe proposals following new legal
OL,22,Fadvice.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
